# The Help page opens these articles in a same-origin <iframe> (src/help/ArticleDialog.tsx).
# The server sends X-Frame-Options: DENY on every response, which blanks that iframe
# ("refused to connect"). Relax framing to same-origin for the articles only; the rest
# of the site keeps DENY.
# `unset` clears a server-level `Header set` (onsuccess table); `always set` replaces a
# server-level `Header always set`. Together they win whichever form the box uses.
<IfModule mod_headers.c>
  Header unset X-Frame-Options
  Header always set X-Frame-Options "SAMEORIGIN"
  Header always set Content-Security-Policy "frame-ancestors 'self'"
</IfModule>
